    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Kelly Hudson Properties present this beautiful four-bedroom detached home is ideally situated in the popular Beechgrove, Bracknagh, Rathangan.\n\nThe property benefits from a modern and contemporary décor, with clean lines and a fresh, stylish finish throughout, making it an ideal choice for families seeking a comfortable and well-appointed home. The accommodation is thoughtfully laid out over two floors and briefly comprises an inviting entrance hallway, a bright and spacious kitchen/dining area, separate utility room and comfortable living room. Two bedrooms are conveniently located on the ground floor, while the first floor provides two further bedrooms, including the generous master bedroom which benefits from its own ensuite.\n\nThe heart of the home is the well-appointed kitchen/dining area, providing a practical and sociable space for everyday family life and entertaining. The living room offers a comfortable retreat, while the utility room provides valuable additional storage and practical space.\n\nOutside, the property boasts a large, private rear garden, offering excellent space for families, outdoor entertaining and relaxation. A dedicated patio area provides the perfect setting for al fresco dining during the warmer months, while the generous garden offers plenty of scope for children to play or for keen gardeners.\n\nWith its attractive modern presentation, versatile four-bedroom accommodation and  substantial private rear garden, this home offers a wonderful combination of style, comfort and practicality in a desirable residential setting. Located in Beechgrove, Bracknagh, the property is within easy reach of Rathangan and offers an excellent opportunity to enjoy a comfortable family home in a well-established residential development.\n\nViewing comes highly recommended strictly by prior appointment only.\n\nACCOMMODATION:\n\nEntrance Hallway: Wooden flooring, recessed spot lights\n\nKitchen/Dining: Tiled flooring, spot lights, fully fitted kitchen, ceramic sink, hot boiling tap, double oven, hob, extractor fan, American style fridge freezer, dishwasher, kitchen island with storage, double doors leading to garden/patio area\n\nUtility Room: Tiled flooring, light fitting, stainless steel sink, built in storage units, back door leading to garden\n\nLiving Room: Wooden flooring, coving, centre rose, feature bay window\n\nMaster Bedroom: Carpet flooring, venetian blinds, fitted wardrobe \n\nEnsuite: Tiled flooring, tiled surround, shower, WHB, WC, shaving light and socket\n\nBedroom 2: Carpet flooring, venetian blinds, fitted wardrobe \n\nBedroom 3: Wooden flooring, venetian blinds, fitted wardrobe  \n\nBedroom 4: Wooden flooring, venetian blinds\n\nFamily Bathroom (Downstairs): Tiled flooring, tiled surround, bath with shower, separate shower unit, WHB, WC\n\nFeatures:\n\nFully wired for alarm\nComposite front door\nComposite triple glazed windows\nSelected carpets and light fittings included\nOutside tap\nOutside light\nOutside electric socket\nPatio area to rear\nBarna shed\nLocated in a quiet cul-de-sac\nNot overlooked\nMains water\nMains sewage\nAir to Water Heating System\nBuilt in 2020\nc.145sqmt\n\nVIEWING IS STRICTLY BY APPOINTMENT ONLY.\n\nThe above particulars are issued by Kelly Hudson Properties on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. Every care is taken in preparing particulars that are issued for guidance only and the firm do not hold themselves responsible for any inaccuracies."
      },
